%20Hi%20Line%20Suite%20Files/Manhattan_Hi_Line_Suite_.dwg","available":true,"availabilityCheckedAt":"2026-11-01","sourceHttpStatus":200},{"label":"Revit Family 3D (.RFA) -","url":"https://res.cloudinary.com/studio-bagno/raw/upload/v1664933771/Studio%20Bagno%20Bathware/Toilets/Toilet%20Suites/Drawing%20Files/Manhattan%20Hi%20Line%20Suite%20Files/Manhattan_Hi_Line_Suite.rfa","available":true,"availabilityCheckedAt":"2026-11-01","sourceHttpStatus":200},{"label":"Sketch Up File (.SKP) -","url":"https://res.cloudinary.com/studio-bagno/raw/upload/v1664933762/Studio%20Bagno%20Bathware/Toilets/Toilet%20Suites/Drawing%20Files/Manhattan%20Hi%20Line%20Suite%20Files/Manhattan_Hi_Line_Suite_.skp","available":true,"availabilityCheckedAt":"2026-11-01","sourceHttpStatus":200},{"label":"Warranty -","url":"https://res.cloudinary.com/studio-bagno/image/upload/v1739330031/sb/Important%20Documents/Warranty-Service-Procedure-110924.pdf","available":true,"availabilityCheckedAt":"2026-11-01","sourceHttpStatus":200},{"label":"Installation Instruction File -","url":"https://res.cloudinary.com/studio-bagno/image/upload/v1677133002/Studio%20Bagno%20Bathware/Toilets/Toilet%20Suites/Toilet%20Suites%20-%20Tech%20Pages/Manhattan-Suite-Instructions-Feb23-R2.pdf","available":true,"availabilityCheckedAt":"2026-11-01","sourceHttpStatus":200}],"summary":"","variants":{"finishes":[{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Manhattan-Hi-Line-Suite_mhl001","selected":true,"targetId":"sku-mhl001","label":"White"}],"tapHoles":[]},"descriptionHtml":"<div>Designed in Australia, The Manhattan Hi Line is the latest edition to our Contemporary collection, building on the success of our Manhattan Suite as a staple in Australian bathrooms. The High Line  is all about improving comfort and experience, with a taller pan &amp; seat height that is also AS 1428.1 Ambulant Compliant.<div>The Manhattan Hi Line boasts crisp contemporary design making it a perfect fit for a vast range of modern bathroom styles. Our superior Rimless technology features a full 360 degree spiral rapid flushing waterway, which has been rigorously tested and refined to create a powerful yet water efficient (WELS 4 Star Rating) Flush. <div><div>Our one-touch quick release seat coupled with the removal of the rim eliminates areas for dirt and grime to build up so cleaning is a breeze. All Studio Bagno toilets come standard with our CleanMax anti0bacterial self cleaning glaze technology, preventing surface dirt accumulation and bacteria breeding, at no extra cost!</div></div><div>Notes: </div><div>• Set out 75-175 mm (S-Trap)</div><div>• Suitable for S-Trap or P-Trap Installation</div><div>• Cleanmax nanotech anti-bacterial surface technology.</div><div>• Available as Back or Bottom Inlet.<br/>• AS 1428.1 Ambulant Compliant.</div></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
